# Responsive UI

- Mobile-first Tailwind classes; enhance at `sm` / `md` / `lg` / `xl` / `2xl`.
- Use `container-page` / shared `Container` for page width.
- Images: predictable aspect ratio; `max-w-full`.
- Test mentally against VIEWPORTS in `~/lib/constants`.
- Add Playwright coverage for new screens when layout is non-trivial.